+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -130,6 +130,10 @@
 
 ### Bug fixes
 
+- Fixed a bug where inlining could generate code referencing an unbound
+  variable when a parameter of an inlined function was used in a case clause
+  guard or a bit array pattern size.
+
 - Fixed a bug where `echo` could crash on JavaScript if the module contains
   record variants with the same name as some built-in JavaScript objects.
   ([Louis Pilfold](https://github.com/lpil))
